ragnar-desktop (1.0-38) forky; urgency=medium

  * labwc rc.xml: enable autoEnableOutputs — with it off, labwc
    never publishes a wl_output on systems without a saved
    ragnar-display-svc profile (fresh live/install sessions),
    leaving clients with no output to map: black screen
  * startragnarlabwc: drop dead environment-file copy — the
    source file is never installed; the labwc bridge's
    EnvironmentWriter creates and owns the file instead

 -- LieraOS Project <projekt@lieraos.local>  Thu, 19 Nov 2026 12:30:00 +0100

ragnar-desktop (1.0-37) forky; urgency=medium

  * Source tree reduced to the session glue: launcher scripts,
    labwc bridge, schemas, icons, data — no compiled code
  * meson build rewritten for the glue package
  * debian/control: minimal dependencies, no GNOME desktop deps
  * Legacy branding and upstream references removed

